IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0028.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 ACCOUNT-TYPE       PIC X.
    05 ACCT-BALANCE       PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 INT-RATE           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM APPLY-INT-TIER
    DISPLAY "INT-RATE=" INT-RATE
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-INT-TIER.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'S' AND ACCT-BALANCE >= 50000
            MOVE 0.0425 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'S' AND ACCT-BALANCE >= 20000
            MOVE 0.0325 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'S'
            MOVE 0.0250 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0100 TO INT-RATE
    END-EVALUATE.
